repository-code: "https://github.com/AirAI-Lab/DAHP-UAV-Detection"
abstract: >-
  A label-only profiler quantifies long-tail, scale imbalance, and confusion
  pathologies in UAV imagery; a bounded policy search then maps the profile,
  through a regime-dependent rebalancing principle, to disclosed
  training-time policies.
keywords:
  - UAV object detection
  - long-tailed recognition
  - data-centric AI
  - exposure-aware rebalancing
  - oversampling
  - VisDrone
  - UAVDT
